  "question": {
    "text": "The mean of five observations is <math><mn>4</mn></math> and their variance is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2.8</mn></math>. If three of these observations are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math>, then the other two are",
