  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mover accent=\"false\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br />and <math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"false\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2.8</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"false\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2.8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"false\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>¯</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></math><br />Where <math><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi></math> are the other two observations.<br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br />Also, <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>1</mn></math><br />Clearly <math><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>6</mn></math> only satisfy the above equations in <math><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>.</mo></math><br />Hence, the required numbers are <math><mn>5,6</mn><mo>.</mo></math>",
